        "statics": "No static child components or public instance methods; defaultProps become synchronous defaults.",
        "subpaths": "Browser root exports both components, hook and types; ./locale aggregates default Provider and named Consumer. Legacy deep component-file paths are not exported. Existing ./locale/source/* and ./locale/interface retain static Node access.",
